# Line endings: LF in the repo and in every working tree, on every OS.
#
# The repo stores LF. Without this file a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true) lands CRLF on disk, so `npm run format:check`
# (Biome, lineEnding: lf) fails on nearly every file locally while CI on
# Linux stays green — a phantom failure that hides real formatting issues.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalised, never diffed as text
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
